# ANTHEM SKELETON
# A skeleton in a common musical-theatre anthem form: a quiet verse with no drums, a second
# verse, a pre-chorus building, a chorus bursting out; the quiet verse again, the pre-chorus,
# the chorus; a bridge and a build to the peak; the last choruses a whole step higher (A flat
# to B flat); an ending. Its story is told in the chords: the verses start on the minor chord
# (vi - IV - I - V: F minor) and sound held back, the chorus on the home chord (I - V - vi - IV:
# A flat) and opens up. In A flat major, the key the original is in; the chords are generic.
# Chords and tempo are this skeleton's own, not any song's; nothing of any song's music is
# here. Channel 3 is empty: keep the verse low and close, climb in the pre-chorus, and let the
# chorus melody reach its highest notes - then the lifted choruses take it higher still.
#
# A starting point made by PokeyTracker's New song window, by rule: each section's beat, bass
# and accompaniment worked out from the key, the chords and the band chosen. The tune is yours.
# Chords: vi IV I V:  Fm Db Ab Eb; in B, I V vi IV:  Ab Eb Fm Db.
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   ANTHEM SKELETON
key    A FLAT MAJOR

# A soft, round bass: the pure tone, plucked and fading - no buzz, one channel, every note
# in tune from C3 up.
instrument SOFTBASS
  table      tone
  volume     12 11 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 4
  distortion tone
  release    2

# A plain square wave, for a tune.
instrument LEAD
  table      tone
  volume     12 11 10 10 9
  distortion tone
  release    2

# Soft keys for an accompaniment: struck, then falling away.
instrument KEYS
  table      tone
  volume     11 10 9 8 8 7 7 6 6 5 5 4
  distortion tone
  release    3

# Four drums: a falling thump, a burst of noise, and a short and a long hiss. Each is a
# table of registers a frame at a time, with no note table, so a key only says which drum.
instrument KICK
  table      none
  volume     15 13 10 7 4 2 0
  distortion buzz
  audf       40 55 70 85 100 115 130

instrument SNARE
  table      none
  volume     13 11 9 7 5 4 3 2 1 0
  distortion tone noise
  audf       50 8 9 10 11 12 13

instrument HAT
  table      none
  volume     8 5 3 1 0
  distortion noise
  audf       2

instrument OPEN
  table      none
  volume     8 7 6 5 4 3 2 2 1 1 0
  distortion noise
  audf       1

channel 1 drums DRUMS
  kit   K=KICK S=SNARE H=HAT O=OPEN
  track A     K . H .  S . H .  K . K .  S . H .
  track A2    K . H .  S . H .  K . S .  S S S S
  track PRE   K . . .  S . . .  K . . .  S . . .
  track PRE2  S . S .  S . S .  S S S S  S S S S
  track B     K . O .  K . O .  K . O .  K . O .
  track B2    S . S .  S . S .  S S S S  S S S S
  track BRIDGE K . H .  H . H .  S . H .  H . H .
  track BRIDGE2 K . H .  S . H .  S . S S  S S S S
  track BUILD   K . S S  K . S .  K . S S  K . S S
  track BUILD2  S . S .  S . S .  S S S S  S S S S
  track LIFT    K . O .  K . O .  K . O .  K . O .
  track LIFT2   S . S .  S . S .  S S S S  S S S S
  track ENDUP   O . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 2 notes BASS
  note  Each section's own bass line, on the chords' roots.
  voice SOFTBASS
  track QUIET F3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET2 Db3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET3 Ab3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET4 Eb3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track A      F3 . . .  C4 . . .  F3 . . .  Eb3 . . .
  track A2     Db4 . . .  Ab4 . . .  Db4 . . .  Bb3 . . .
  track A3     Ab3 . . .  Eb4 . . .  Ab3 . . .  F3 . . .
  track A4     Eb3 . . .  Bb3 . . .  Eb3 . . .  Bb3 . . .
  track PRE    F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . Eb3 .
  track PRE2   Db3 . Db4 .  Db3 . Db4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .
  track B      Ab3 . Ab4 .  Ab3 . Ab4 .  Ab3 . Ab4 .  Ab3 . F3 .
  track B2     Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .
  track B3     F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . Eb3 .
  track B4     Db3 . Db4 .  Db3 . Db4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . G3 .
  track BRIDGE F3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BRIDGE2 Db3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BUILD   F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . Eb3 .
  track BUILD2  Db3 . Db4 .  Db3 . Db4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .
  track LIFT    Bb3 . Bb4 .  Bb3 . Bb4 .  Bb3 . Bb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track LIFT2   F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . F4 .
  track LIFT3   G3 . G4 .  G3 . G4 .  G3 . G4 .  G3 . F3 .
  track LIFT4   Eb3 . Eb4 .  Eb3 . Eb4 .  F3 . F4 .  F3 . A3 .
  track ENDUP   Bb3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 3 notes LEAD
  note  Empty: the tune is yours.
  voice LEAD
  track QUIET . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET2 . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET3 . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track QUIET4 . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track A      . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track A2     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track A3     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track A4     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track PRE    . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track PRE2   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track B      . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track B2     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track B3     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track B4     . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BRIDGE . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BRIDGE2 . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BUILD   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track BUILD2  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track LIFT    . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track LIFT2   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track LIFT3   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track LIFT4   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .
  track ENDUP   . . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 4 notes PATTERN
  note  Broken chord, up and back, on each chord.
  voice KEYS
  track QUIET F3 . Ab3 .  C4 . F4 .  Ab4 . F4 .  C4 . Ab3 .
  track QUIET2 Db3 . F3 .  Ab3 . Db4 .  F4 . Db4 .  Ab3 . F3 .
  track QUIET3 Ab3 . C4 .  Eb4 . Ab4 .  C5 . Ab4 .  Eb4 . C4 .
  track QUIET4 Eb3 . G3 .  Bb3 . Eb4 .  G4 . Eb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track A      F3 . Ab3 .  C4 . F4 .  Ab4 . F4 .  C4 . Ab3 .
  track A2     Db3 . F3 .  Ab3 . Db4 .  F4 . Db4 .  Ab3 . F3 .
  track A3     Ab3 . C4 .  Eb4 . Ab4 .  C5 . Ab4 .  Eb4 . C4 .
  track A4     Eb3 . G3 .  Bb3 . Eb4 .  G4 . Eb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track PRE    F3 . Ab3 .  C4 . F4 .  Ab4 . F4 .  C4 . Ab3 .
  track PRE2   Db3 . F3 .  Ab3 . Db4 .  G4 . Eb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track B      Ab . . .  Ab . . .  Ab . . .  Ab . . .
  track B2     Eb . . .  Eb . . .  Eb . . .  Eb . . .
  track B3     Fm . . .  Fm . . .  Fm . . .  Fm . . .
  track B4     Db . . .  Db . . .  Eb . . .  Eb . . .
  track BRIDGE F3 . Ab3 .  C4 . F4 .  Ab4 . F4 .  C4 . Ab3 .
  track BRIDGE2 Db3 . F3 .  Ab3 . Db4 .  G4 . Eb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track BUILD   F3 . Ab3 .  C4 . F4 .  Ab4 . F4 .  C4 . Ab3 .
  track BUILD2  Db3 . F3 .  Ab3 . Db4 .  G4 . Eb4 .  Bb3 . G3 .
  track LIFT    Bb . . .  Bb . . .  Bb . . .  Bb . . .
  track LIFT2   F . . .  F . . .  F . . .  F . . .
  track LIFT3   Gm . . .  Gm . . .  Gm . . .  Gm . . .
